#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:191
msgid "Aerobatic Tuning"
msgstr "特技调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:7
#: 5a6bec262d7543ec9640b1d4290f0ea5
msgid "Scripted Aerobatics"
msgstr "脚本化特技飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:10
#: bf29da06a56e4118b634bdf8a0ddbcce
msgid "this capability is in ArduPlane 4.2 and higher"
msgstr "此功能适用于 ArduPlane 4.2 及更高版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:12
#: c8a2daeba0c3411484fe29e836ef045f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has the capability of executing aerobatics from a LUA script. "
"Either via AUTO mode mission items, or via scripts executed in many normal "
"plane flight modes, usually controlled via a transmitter switch and "
"selection RC channels."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持通过 LUA 脚本执行特技飞行动作。既可通过 Auto "
"模式任务项执行，也可在许多正常固定翼飞行模式下通过脚本运行，通常由遥控器开关和选择 RC 通道进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:14
#: 044add6dc0834e52850599d1a467daff
msgid ""
"this requires a vehicle capable of aerobatic flight, properly tuned "
"pitch,roll, and yaw rate controllers, and the pilot should be capable of "
"safely taking over control (by switch or mode change) the vehicle while in "
"an unusual attitude, if the need arises. The ``ACRO_x_RATE`` parameters "
"limit the maximum commanded rate for each axis, as in ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"此功能要求飞机具备特技飞行能力，且俯仰、横滚和偏航速率控制器已正确调参。飞手应具备在飞机处于异常姿态时安全接管控制权（通过拨动开关或切换飞行模式）的能力。``ACRO_x_RATE``"
" 参数限制每个轴的最大指令速率，与 Acro 模式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:17
#: c22a66405a93474a8714963dd187932b
msgid "Mission NAV_SCRIPT_TIME"
msgstr "任务 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:19
#: d80f768bd4dd424e925e854f0d477d78
msgid ""
"The SCRIPT_TIME waypoint type allows for a :ref:`LUA<common-lua-scripts>` "
"script to take control of the roll/pitch/yaw rates of the vehicle for a "
"time. For protection against lack of an appropriate script being active (ie "
"was not loaded in the APM/Scripts directory of the SD card) to assume "
"control, or LUA script crash due to error, there is a mandatory parameter "
"which provides a maximum time the script can takeover, before the next "
"mission item is executed. An additional layer of protection is provided "
"within the firmware execution of the NAV_SCRIPT_TIME command that requires "
"the script to access it within every 200ms, so the command's timeout "
"parameter (P2) can be set to 0 (unlimited time out) for longer running "
"aerobatics sequences (> 255 seconds), IF they are known to be otherwise "
"well-behaved and present on the SD card."
msgstr ""
"SCRIPT_TIME 航点类型允许 :ref:`LUA<common-lua-scripts>` "
"脚本在一段时间内接管飞机横滚/俯仰/偏航速率控制。为防止合适的脚本未激活（即未加载到 SD 卡 APM/Scripts 目录）或 LUA "
"脚本因错误崩溃，设有一个强制参数用于指定脚本可接管的最大时间，超时后将执行下一个任务项。固件在执行 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME "
"命令时还提供额外保护层，要求脚本每 200ms 至少访问一次该命令，因此对于较长的特技飞行序列（>255 秒），如果确认脚本行为正常且 SD "
"卡上已存在脚本，可将命令的超时参数（P2）设为 0（无限超时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:21
#: bda0168a5c6b48aaa22b7823fc6cddd2
msgid "The format of the SCRIPT_TIME item is:"
msgstr "SCRIPT_TIME 任务项的格式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:71
#: 351ce647b45a4ce5b9e6aa7614510d74
msgid ""
"A LUA script would need to be running when the above mission command is "
"encountered to recognize that it needs to take control, and start sending "
"pitch/roll/yaw rate inputs into the autopilot to control its attitude and/or"
" trajectory. It can use the four variable input parameters of the command to"
" control aspects of the maneuver, such as rate of rolls/loops, repeat "
"counts, time for certain segments of the maneuver, etc. An example is "
"provided in the LUA Scripting Applet directory called `plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing>`__"
" for several types of tricks and full aerobatic schedules."
msgstr ""
"当上述任务命令被触发时，需要有一个 LUA "
"脚本正在运行，以识别需要接管控制并开始向飞控发送俯仰/横滚/偏航速率输入来控制飞机姿态和/或轨迹。脚本可利用命令的四个可变输入参数来控制动作的各个方面，如横滚/循环的速率、重复次数、动作特定阶段的时间等。LUA"
" 脚本小程序目录中提供了一个名为 `plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing>`__"
" 的示例，涵盖多种特技类型及完整特技飞行程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:73
#: 6d2b547553cf4d6aa6d9d35916ea2651
msgid ""
"The execution of a script running during the NAV_SCRIPT_TIME item can easily"
" be interrupted by switching modes out of AUTO."
msgstr "在 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 任务项执行期间运行的脚本，可通过切换出 Auto 模式来轻松中断。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:75
#: e9ded0ce383f4f7bb4f08fc21d4d101d
msgid ""
"returning to AUTO mode would resume the AUTO mission at the last item before"
" switching modes. If this was a NAV_SCRIPT_TIME command it would re-start "
"from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"返回 Auto 模式将从切换模式前的上一个任务项继续执行 Auto 任务。若该项为 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 命令，则将从头重新开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:77
#: 1d932b60e7d247b2ae97a72b01f2d759
msgid ""
"be sure to have valid waypoints before and after a NAV_SCRIPT_TIME sequence "
"of commands in order to establish path for the scripts to use (optionally) "
"and to have sufficient altitude before trying this feature."
msgstr "请确保在 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 命令序列前后设置有效航点，以便为脚本建立路径（可选），并在尝试此功能前确保有足够的飞行高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:79
#: 08e0fe0054e84f95b2dbd7ae59d207c0
msgid ""
"if you create your mission, and place the LUA script you intend to use in "
"the /scripts subdirectory of a SITL simulation, you can test the script and "
"the mission without risking your vehicle."
msgstr "若在 SITL 仿真的 /scripts 子目录中创建任务并放置计划使用的 LUA 脚本，可在不损坏实机的情况下测试脚本和任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:82
#: eae2b8d71fd94294bf731efb005440c3
msgid ""
"Trajectory Precise Plane Aerobatics LUA script (firmware 4.4 and higher)"
msgstr "轨迹精确固定翼特技飞行 LUA 脚本（固件 4.4 及更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:84
#: a880c7c06fb54817a72ce0e8882ab059
msgid ""
"A trajectory precise (attempts to track an exact earth referenced geospatial"
" path), plane aerobatics script example is provided in the LUA Scripting "
"Applet directory called `plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing>`__"
" . This LUA applet has a multitude of maneuvers, as well as complete "
"sequences of routines, and the ability to easily create and add new sequence"
" of routines."
msgstr ""
"LUA 脚本小程序目录中提供了一个轨迹精确（尝试跟踪精确的地球参考地理空间路径）的固定翼特技飞行脚本示例，名为 "
"`plane_aerobatics.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing>`__。该"
" LUA 小程序包含大量动作以及完整的飞行程序序列，并支持轻松创建和添加新的程序序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:86
#: 907f9a0173c54e9c82d447cc9121f82b
msgid ""
"These tricks and sequences can be either run as part of a mission using the "
"NAV_SCRIPT_TIME mission command above, or activated by a switch on the RC "
"transmitter."
msgstr "这些特技动作和序列既可作为任务的一部分通过上述 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 任务命令运行，也可通过 RC 遥控器上的开关激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:88
#: c06932eaf0784beda083e646fcdf714f
msgid ""
"The script provides numerous individual tricks, and a table of their IDs is "
"provided in the `README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/README.md>`__"
" file. Below is a list, but future expansion is anticipated so check the "
"README:"
msgstr ""
"该脚本提供了大量单独特技动作，其 ID 表格收录于 `README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/README.md>`__"
" 文件。以下为列表，但预计未来会有扩展，请查阅 README："

