#: 2db92d47be18425cad80d8a5ddf63b60
msgid ""
"This applet also provides a means to execute tricks or sequences via an RC "
"Switch in normal modes like ACRO, LOITER, CRUISE, or FBWA."
msgstr "该小程序还支持在 Acro、LOITER、CRUISE 或 FBWA 等正常飞行模式下通过 RC 开关执行特技或序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:137
#: e0be3116d1ce4a7fa07e14e5f793ee2c
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:139
#: b1278ebd19a042c7adc27698e40bbeda
msgid ""
"Make sure you have Autotuned your plane and that its capable of doing "
"aerobatics in ACRO mode well (Bixlers and flying wings only can do rolls and"
" loops, generally, since they have insufficient yaw authority and side "
"fuselage area...ie must be able to knife edge for full capability). This "
"includes Autotuning the new YAW rate controller. Enable "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` and set "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` appropriately (90deg/s is a good start)."
" When you Autotune, not only do pitch and roll, but also yaw by exercising "
"the rudder, like pitch and roll."
msgstr ""
"确保已对飞机进行 Autotune，且飞机能在 Acro 模式下良好执行特技飞行（Bixler "
"和飞翼一般只能做横滚和筋斗，因为它们偏航控制权限不足，机身侧面面积不够……即必须能做刀锋飞行才具备完整能力）。这包括对新的偏航速率控制器进行 "
"Autotune。启用 :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` 并适当设置 "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` （90度/秒是个好的起点）。进行 Autotune "
"时，不仅要做俯仰和横滚，还要通过拨动方向舵进行偏航，方式与俯仰和横滚相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:140
#: 36c31d7d5828422f869e45789948893e
msgid ""
"Enable scripting, on an autopilot that is capable (F7 or H7) with "
":ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1, reboot and set "
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` = 250000 (you will need more if other "
"scripts are running also) and :ref:`SCR_VM_I_COUNT<SCR_VM_I_COUNT>` = "
"200000."
msgstr ""
"在具备能力的飞控（F7 或 H7）上通过 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1 启用脚本，重启后设置 "
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` = 250000（若有其他脚本同时运行则需更多），以及 "
":ref:`SCR_VM_I_COUNT<SCR_VM_I_COUNT>` = 200000。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:141
#: 7e30f34924024006914da534baee47d9
msgid ""
"Copy the `plane_aerobatic.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/FixedWing>`__"
" script into your SD card APM/scripts directory. Use the RAW view and copy "
"to files on the SD card. Reboot."
msgstr ""
"将 `plane_aerobatic.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/FixedWing>`__"
" 脚本复制到 SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录。请使用 RAW 视图查看并将文件复制到 SD 卡。重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:142
#: c3f1ca34128d476ab7e1ae3598db825f
msgid ""
"If you want to activate tricks and schedules from an RC switch, assign an RC"
" channel to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 300 for the trick activation switch "
"(low=disable,mid=show trick number selected, high= do it) and one for 301 "
"which is trick selection. This normally a pot or slider, but can be any "
"switch (which limits the number of tricks to the number of switch "
"positions). Set the ``TRIK_ENABLE`` to 1 and reboot. Then set `TRIK_COUNT`` "
"parameter to the number of tricks (11 maximum) to be selectable by the trick"
" selection channel. Reboot."
msgstr ""
"若要通过 RC 开关激活特技和程序，将 RC 通道分配 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 300 "
"作为特技激活开关（低=禁用，中=显示所选特技编号，高=执行），另一个分配 301 "
"作为特技选择。通常使用旋钮或滑块，也可使用任意开关（这会将特技数量限制为开关位数）。设置 ``TRIK_ENABLE`` 为 1 并重启。然后将 "
"`TRIK_COUNT`` 参数设置为可由特技选择通道选择的特技数量（最多 11 个）。重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:143
#: 6119f1348a9541dbac2bf2a8aa6226f5
msgid ""
"For each trick/schedule, set its corresponding "
"``TRIKn_ID/ARG1/ARG2/ARG3/ARG4`` parameters. For example, if you wish TRIK3 "
"to be a Vertical Box, 50 meters tall, 100 meters long, with corner radii of "
"15 meters, set ``TRIK3_ID`` = 5, ``TRIK3_ARG1`` = 100, ``TRIK3_ARG2`` = 50, "
"and ``TRIK3_ARG3`` = 15. Other TRIK3 argument values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"对于每个特技/程序，设置对应的 ``TRIKn_ID/ARG1/ARG2/ARG3/ARG4`` 参数。例如，若要将 TRIK3 设为 50 "
"米高、100 米长、转角半径 15 米的 Vertical Box，则设置 ``TRIK3_ID`` = 5、``TRIK3_ARG1`` = "
"100、``TRIK3_ARG2`` = 50、``TRIK3_ARG3`` = 15，其他 TRIK3 参数值忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:144
#: 6b62c3101be1410aae184e861b791c8b
msgid ""
"Setting the activation switch to mid position will identify the trick number"
" selected by the selection channel on the ground station or TX, if running "
":ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>` telemetry."
msgstr ""
"将激活开关拨至中间位置，可在地面站或遥控器上（如运行 :ref:`Yaapu <common-frsky-yaapu>` "
"数传）显示选择通道所选的特技编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:145
#: 7a19b0203c3640fbbb753d4802fccdeb
msgid ""
"You can abort out of the trick by putting activation switch low, change "
"modes, or set selector to 0. A trick or sequence will also abort if the "
"programmed trajectory is not being met with an error limit. This usually "
"indicates a lack of sufficient vehicle tuning or power."
msgstr ""
"可通过将激活开关拨低、切换飞行模式或将选择器置为 0 "
"来中止特技。如果编程轨迹未在误差范围内得到跟踪，特技或序列也会自动中止，这通常表明飞机调参不足或动力不够。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:149
#: c8dacad42fb4417fa22ad18d7b4eb4d6
msgid ""
"Remember: ALTITUDE IS YOUR FRIEND! dont attempt your first one below "
"200feet! and FPV is a good way to try it out first, if you have trouble with"
" seeing the vehicle at that altitude."
msgstr "记住：高度是你的朋友！首次尝试不要低于 200 英尺！如果在该高度难以看清飞机，FPV 是一个很好的试飞方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:152
#: b1a654d7c67f4287b6c9e2cf39286a07
msgid "AEROM Parameters"
msgstr "AEROM 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:154
#: f2b59b4dfcd54257a5b9382c1de479df
msgid ""
"Many new parameters will appear when this script is loaded, which control "
"the tuning of the tricks. See the `README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/README.md>`__"
" file for up to date information, but a few should be changed from their "
"defaults in most cases:"
msgstr ""
"加载此脚本后将出现许多新参数，用于控制特技的调参。有关最新信息请查看 `README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/README.md>`__"
" 文件，但在大多数情况下以下几个参数需要从默认值修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:156
#: 91e22bf391634c9286c4b4b267f50747
msgid ""
"``AEROM_PATH_SCALE`` this is probably the most critical when using the "
"example schedules. Individual tricks in a mission, or a trick on a switch, "
"can adjust the trick dimensions with the TRIKx_ARGy parameters. But the "
"schedules, unless edited, have dimensions suited to high performance pattern"
" planes with significant vertical speed capability. For normal 3D planes or "
"sport planes these are too aggressive and the sequence will probably abort "
"on many tricks, especially in wind. However, if you lower the path scale "
"from \"1\" (no scaling) to \".75\", more normal 3D planes will be able to "
"execute the schedule. For marginally powered (can barely hover vertically) "
"planes, even a \".5\" scale factor, or less, might be required, scaling all "
"radii and lengths of the pattern by 50%."
msgstr ""
"``AEROM_PATH_SCALE`` 这可能是使用示例程序时最关键的参数。任务中的单个特技或开关特技可通过 TRIKx_ARGy "
"参数调整特技尺寸。但程序序列（除非经过编辑）的尺寸是为具有显著垂直速度能力的高性能表演机设计的，对于普通 3D "
"飞机或运动飞机来说过于激进，序列可能在很多特技上中止，尤其是在有风时。如果将路径比例从 「1」（不缩放）降低到 「.75」，较普通的 3D "
"飞机将能够执行程序序列。对于动力勉强够用（刚好能垂直悬停）的飞机，可能需要 「.5」 的比例因子甚至更低，将所有图形的半径和长度缩小 50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:157
#: c83eddf7556d40caae64002de48c65ad
msgid ""
"``AEROM_THR_MIN`` should be set to 15-20 (%) to maintain inertia at the "
"bottom of loops, etc."
msgstr "``AEROM_THR_MIN`` 应设置为 15-20（%）以在筋斗底部等处维持惯性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:158
#: ecc6cc867cc248cb8f6d73418371b6de
msgid ""
"``AEROM_KE_ANG`` most planes need a little boost to the knife edge rudder, "
"so setting this 10 is usually needed"
msgstr "``AEROM_KE_ANG`` 大多数飞机需要稍微增强刀锋飞行的方向舵，因此通常需要将此值设为 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:159
#: b50fb3410eea4deda582780bafd52833
msgid ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`: while the script does NOT use the "
"airspeed sensor, it  uses GPS velocity to track the trajectory and this "
"parameter to set target ground speeds. As such you may wish to set this "
"(even if there is no airspeed sensor) to a \"fast\" cruise speed within the "
"vehicles capability. Flying on the fast end of cruise helps deal with wind "
"impacts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`：虽然脚本不使用空速传感器，但它使用 GPS "
"速度来跟踪轨迹，并使用此参数设定目标地速。因此，即使没有空速传感器，也可以将此值设为飞机能力范围内的「较快」巡航速速。以较快的巡航速度飞行有助于应对风的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:162
#: 5738e0c757db40378be3f2e5d258e5b6
msgid "Schedules"
msgstr "程序序列"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:163
#: 6618e410f82b496286bd6537077a148d
msgid ""
"The applet also allows loading sequences of tricks to perform contest "
"schedules like F3A or airshows as a single trick which can be executed from "
"a mission or as Trick on a Switch. These are text files of the form "
"``trickX.txt``, where X would be the trick id, and located in the /scripts "
"directory, or the root directory on the SD card where the "
"plane_aerobatics.lua script is stored. These should not be the same number "
"as existing tricks."
msgstr ""
"该小程序还支持加载特技序列来执行 F3A 竞赛程序或飞行表演，作为单个特技，可从任务中执行或作为开关特技执行。这些是形如 ``trickX.txt`` "
"的文本文件，其中 X 为特技 ID，存放于 /scripts 目录或存储 plane_aerobatics.lua 脚本的 SD "
"卡根目录。这些文件的编号不应与现有特技重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:166
#: 53a6e998139e45d6a5e2dbe62c5b9496
msgid ""
"An example for a schedule is included as `trick72.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/trick72.txt>`__"
" and would be executed as ``TRIKx_ID`` = 72 via switch or in an AUTO mission"
" command. The schedule will display its \"name\" when started, and as each "
"trick begins a \"message\" will sent to the GCS to indicate its start."
msgstr ""
"作为程序示例，`trick72.txt "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/trick72.txt>`__"
" 已包含在内，可通过开关或 AUTO 任务命令以 ``TRIKx_ID`` = 72 "
"执行。程序开始时将显示其「名称」，每个特技开始时向地面站发送「消息」以指示其启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:168
#: a9196181161740d1bca7dfaa0eed4e0e
msgid ""
"Several sequences, such as F3A, etc. are included in the `Schedules folder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/Schedules>`__."
" The above 'trick72.txt' is the SuperAirshow Sequence, consisting of "
"Loop/HalfReverseCubanEight/ScaleFigureEight/Immelmann/Roll/Split-S/RollingCircle/HumptyBump/Barrel"
" Rool/Cross Box TopHat/Triangular Loop:"
msgstr ""
"在 `程序文件夹 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/Aerobatics/FixedWing/Schedules>`__"
" 中包含了多个序列，如 F3A 等。上述 「trick72.txt」 是 SuperAirshow "
"序列，由以下动作组成：Loop/HalfReverseCubanEight/ScaleFigureEight/Immelmann/Roll/Split-S/RollingCircle/HumptyBump/Barrel"
" Rool/Cross Box TopHat/Triangular Loop："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:173
#: 4fc692bf2f6a42e187a56782a49e4840
msgid ""
"Adding new basic tricks can also be done via a schedule file. This is shown "
"in the SuperAirShow schedule file where a triangle loop and a crossbox "
"tophat trick have been created and loaded with the schedule sequence."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过程序文件添加新的基本特技。在 SuperAirShow 程序文件中即展示了这一点，其中已创建并加载了三角形筋斗和 crossbox "
"tophat 特技及程序序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:176
#: 72fa8cf7a1f040d495a10b579ac339f4
msgid "Trick File Commands"
msgstr "特技文件命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:178
#: f764057c4b314ef5bb989eb17569e418
msgid "Several commands can be used within the trick file:"
msgstr "特技文件中可以使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:180
#: 7ac5a63af16e494583962916aab58cf2
msgid "name: <the name of the Trick>"
msgstr "name: <特技名称>"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:181
#: 942a52c454254d3f9ec297061277cf4d
msgid ""
"message: <usually the trick name>  displayed as a GCS message. This should "
"be positioned immediately before the trick"
msgstr "message: <通常是特技名称>  作为地面站消息显示，应紧靠在特技之前"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:182
#: 7a0f6afbae724cc2b94618d2c5625d63
msgid ""
"<trick name> <param1><parm2>..<param4>   the subroutine name in the "
"plane_aerobatics file that actually performs the trick and its passed "
"parameters"
msgstr "<特技名称> <参数1><参数2>..<参数4>   plane_aerobatics 文件中实际执行该特技的子程序名称及其传入参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:183
#: af51fac786ac467b990cc7eceec1022b
msgid ""
"align_center:   this will wait to start the following trick until the "
"vehicle is centered, or if beyond the center (in the direction of flight) of"
" the aerobatic box, immediately. The center is where the trick schedule was "
"started."
msgstr ""
"align_center：等待下一个特技开始，直到飞机到达中心位置，或者若飞机已越过中心（沿飞行方向），则立即执行。中心为特技程序开始时的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:184
#: 477c72412ced40c3b5dd351702cd37c5
msgid ""
"align_box x:  this positions the start of the next trick \"x\" from the box "
"end in the direction of travel, ie \"1\" would make the trick be aligned at "
"the box end, while .75 would start it 3/4 the way from center to it. Usually"
" a value of \"1\" is used."
msgstr ""
"align_box x：将下一个特技的起始位置定位在距飞行方向箱体端点 「x」 处，即 「1」 表示特技在箱体端点对齐，「.75」 "
"表示从中心到箱体端点的 3/4 处开始。通常使用 「1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:187
#: dcb8e502479e47d89d8f25d9cd898381
msgid "Tuning for Aerobatics"
msgstr "特技飞行调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:189
#: 431beed6392f4189836e723a86e536fc
msgid ""
"Normal ArduPilot Autotune provides a safe, stable PID tune for most "
"vehicles. As such, its not optimized for precision aerobatics which require "
"a tight tune. See below:"
msgstr ""
"正常的 ArduPilot Autotune 为大多数飞机提供安全稳定的 PID 调参。因此，它并未针对需要精确调参的精准特技飞行进行优化。请参见下文："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:197
#: 81bc13901626431ea26d14288d8c6873
msgid "Analyzing Performance"
msgstr "性能分析"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:199
#: baab0d50e01c4e1b8afb7170077390f9
msgid ""
"Analyzing the resulting execution of the trick(s) or schedules can easily be"
" done by using the `Plot3d tool <http://plot3d.ardupilot.org>`__ which "
"displays the programmed path and the actual executed path graphically. The "
"first part of the timeline will trace the programmed path, while the second "
"half traces the actual. Both are overlaid at the start to show path errors. "
"The lua script will log additional items while executing the trick(s) to "
"allow this tool to display this information."
msgstr ""
"分析特技或程序的执行效果，可通过使用 `Plot3d 工具 <http://plot3d.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"轻松完成，该工具以图形方式显示编程路径和实际执行路径。时间轴的前半部分描绘编程路径，后半部分描绘实际路径，两者在起点叠加以显示路径误差。LUA "
"脚本在执行特技时会记录额外信息，以便该工具显示这些信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:201
#: 53287a3418bd407aa804cb5e20ba0846
msgid ""
"To use this tool, load your flight log file using the **Load BIN** button, "
"select \"manual\" site selection and **Copy Origin** to set the view to you "
"home location."
msgstr ""
"使用此工具时，用 **Load BIN** 按钮加载飞行日志文件，选择「手动」站点选择并 **Copy Origin** 将视图设置为 Home 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:206
#: 16d7cd9c85eb4e498c949f4cc27f6c16
msgid ""
"Overlaid on the above image is the second tool: using the ``AERT.Perr`` log "
"message which shows the 3D position error from programmed path in meters. "
"The above shows that the vehicle was blown downwind in high crosswinds out "
"of the rolling circle by 15m at one point. This was greatly improved in "
"later flights by increasing the speed at which the plane did the routine "
"(increase :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`)"
msgstr ""
"叠加在上图上的第二个工具：使用 ``AERT.Perr`` "
"日志消息，显示飞机与编程路径的三维位置误差（单位：米）。上图显示飞机在强侧风中执行滚转圆时被吹离轨道达 15 "
"米。在后续飞行中通过提高飞机执行程序的速度（增大 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`）大幅改善了这一情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:210
#: 97f3558869eb46e18abdf562e9f2c11f
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:212
#: ad997dd1571849ab82d3bdf97cb61c27
msgid ""
"Using SITL, especially in conjunction with :ref:`RealFlight<dev:sitl-with-"
"realflight>` and a RealFlight model like the `AddictionX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SITL_Models/tree/master/RealFlight/Released_Models/Planes/Addiction_3D>`__,"
" makes development and debugging much easier without risking a real vehicle."
" However, simulation can also be done without RealFlight using Mission "
"Planner alone with ArduPilot's provided 3D plane model."
msgstr ""
"使用 SITL，尤其是结合 :ref:`RealFlight<dev:sitl-with-realflight>` 和类似 `AddictionX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SITL_Models/tree/master/RealFlight/Released_Models/Planes/Addiction_3D>`__"
" 的 RealFlight 模型，可在不损坏实机的情况下大幅简化开发和调试工作。此外，仅使用 Mission Planner 配合 ArduPilot "
"提供的 3D 飞机模型，也可以进行不依赖 RealFlight 的仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:214
#: d72e5ee63723473eb70225c07636887a
msgid ""
"Below is a video showing simulation using Mission Planner and the built-in "
"3D plane simulation:"
msgstr "以下视频展示了使用 Mission Planner 和内置 3D 飞机仿真的模拟效果："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:218
#: 4515ef002c004b569721bdd38a18dae6
msgid ""
"If you are using RealFlight for simulations, here is how to setup the "
"Addiction 3D model to do scripted trajectory aerobatics:"
msgstr "如果使用 RealFlight 进行仿真，以下是配置 Addiction 3D 模型执行脚本轨迹特技的方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:223
#: 225e2c5101dc498ca05e863eceeee45e
msgid "Script Calls into the firmware"
msgstr "脚本对固件的调用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:225
#: 716ab3a21b154bf0a18604e99ae17c12
msgid ""
"Other scripts can be developed which allow control of the vehicle, either "
"via NAV_SCRIPT_TIME mission items or from normal flight modes. The key calls"
" are:"
msgstr "可以开发其他脚本来控制飞机，无论是通过 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 任务项还是从正常飞行模式。关键调用如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:227
#: 0f499d58d55d494ca8e29907a09f3d9b
msgid ""
"Enabling scripting control override of roll/pitch/yaw rates and throttle "
"with a specific call \"vehicle:nav_scripting_enable(..)\" which returns a "
"boolean indicating  success or failure."
msgstr ""
"通过特定调用 "
"「vehicle:nav_scripting_enable(..)」启用脚本对横滚/俯仰/偏航速率及油门的控制覆盖，该调用返回布尔值表示成功或失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:229
#: 4f5e61636ef54ddc802f84aefaf12417
msgid ""
"Obtaining the arguments of a NAV_SCRIPT_TIME command using "
"\"vehicle:nav_script_time()\" if running while in AUTO mode."
msgstr "在 Auto 模式运行时，通过 「vehicle:nav_script_time()」获取 NAV_SCRIPT_TIME 命令的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripted-aerobatics-4.4.rst:231
#: 26c845dd83944fb19b571b639bae2875
msgid ""
"Controlling the above rates and throttle with the "
"\"vehicle:set_target_throttle_rate_rpy(....)\" function, which must be "
"called regularly (at least every second) to set the roll/pitch/yaw rates and"
" throttle percentage. Failure to do so, will disable the control override "
"and return control to the original flight mode. Changing flight modes also "
"disables script control."
msgstr ""
"通过 "
"「vehicle:set_target_throttle_rate_rpy(....)」函数控制上述速率和油门，该函数必须定期调用（至少每秒一次）以设置横滚/俯仰/偏航速率和油门百分比。若未及时调用，将禁用控制覆盖并将控制权返还给原飞行模式。切换飞行模式也会禁用脚本控制。"
